  "notes": "Views identified as front circular view (X-Y) and section A-A through the axis (Z-depth horizontal in section). Part modeled as two coaxial cylinders: Ø76 flange, 18 mm thick, plus rear Ø48 boss to 26 mm overall depth. Central Ø28 through bore with Ø38 x 16 front counterbore; four equally spaced Ø5.3 counterbored holes on Ø56 bolt circle with Ø7.8 counterbores 4 mm deep. One Ø5 radial cross-hole is shown in section at 7 mm from the front face and at 30 degrees in the front view; it is approximated as an axis-aligned radial cut at the bottom because the schema does not support arbitrarily angled cut cylinders. Rear boss length 8 mm derived from 26 overall minus 18 flange thickness."
